    "sources": [
      "The curators' starter deck for Night Thrasher (night_thrasher_dh/decks/night-thrasher-justice.json in mc-digital-custom-packs, commit 221b4e4), not the pack author's. Starter deck for Night Thrasher with the Justice aspect, 43 cards. Built on MarvelCDB with Adam Warlock standing in for Night Thrasher (his pack isn't on MarvelCDB): Warlock's 15 hero cards are swapped for Night Thrasher's 16. Tech Deck lets him add 4 Skill cards from other aspects: Martial Prowess (Aggression) and 3 Repurpose (Protection), which discards the deck's Tech upgrades."
    ]
